I created a tileset which is sort of a cross between the default
tileset and the original ASCII characters; the idea is to see a whole
level at once and get more info about what you are seeing, while still
preserving some of that original flavor. 

I've finished a fairly massive overhaul of the set, thus the "2.0",
and the results are available here:

http://www.olywa.net/cook/nhack.htm

Whether or not you've used my set in the past, let me know what you
think.


